                                                </div>
                                                <div class='chat-text'>Are we meeting today?<br />Project has been already finished and I
                                                    have results to show you.</div>
                                                <div class='chat-hour'>08:57 <span class='icon-done_all'></span></div>
                                            </li>
                                            <li class='chat-right'>
                                                <div class='chat-hour'>08:59 <span class='icon-done_all'></span></div>
                                                <div class='chat-text'>Well I am not sure.<br />I have results to show you.</div>
                                                <div class='chat-avatar'>
                                                    <img src="img/user1.png" alt="Low Price Admin Templates" />
                                                    <div class='chat-name'>You</div>
                                                </div>
                                            </li>
                                            <li class='chat-left'>
                                                <div class='chat-avatar'>
                                                    <img src="img/user3.png" alt="Low Price Admin Templates" />
                                                    <div class='chat-name'>Russell</div>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class='chat-text'>The rest of the team is not here yet.<br />Maybe in an hour or so?
